      "spam": false,
      "value": "This is something I have on our roadmap. It might be a while though as we have other things ahead of it. It's something personal to me as I perform live and very much want to perform in VRChat. As do others. Hooking it into the room instead of an avatar is the way forward. Also allowing the splitting of a signal to include left and right from a stereo source so things like speakers can be positioned. Also the ability to get an FFT channel break out to feed say up to 8 frequencies to drive things like visuals and events.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
