      "value": "Reverting back to Open! This is not actively being worked on, nor do we have plans to work on it in the immediate future. However, it is a good idea.\nAlthough we do eventually plan to have a feature like this, many VRChat players think that the Planned status means we've got a set date and time that we'll be releasing this. *We don't!*\nIt simply means we've read this and said \"Hmm, yeah, good idea. Let's look into this later.\"\nThat's it. :S",
